<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Fee Structure - Smart School</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>

<body>

    <%- include ("_header.ejs") %>

<main class="fees-page">

    <p class="eyebrow">Parent information</p>
    <h2>School Fee Structure</h2>

    <p>Review the current term fees and follow the payment steps below.</p>

    <table>

        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Class</th>
                <th>Term</th>
                <th>Tuition Fee (KSh)</th>
                <th>Activity Fee (KSh)</th>
                <th>Total (KSh)</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>

        <tbody>

            <tr>
                <td>Form 1</td>
                <td>Term 1</td>
                <td>20,000</td>
                <td>2,000</td>
                <td>22,000</td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td>Form 2</td>
                <td>Term 1</td>
                <td>20,000</td>
                <td>2,000</td>
                <td>22,000</td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td>Form 3</td>
                <td>Term 1</td>
                <td>22,000</td>
                <td>2,000</td>
                <td>24,000</td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td>Form 4</td>
                <td>Term 1</td>
                <td>22,000</td>
                <td>2,000</td>
                <td>24,000</td>
            </tr>

        </tbody>

    </table>

    <section class="payment-guide">
        <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">How to pay</p>
            <h3>Complete your payment in three steps</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="payment-steps">
            <article>
                <span>01</span>
                <h4>Confirm the amount</h4>
                <p>Use your child's class and the total shown above. Contact the office if the account has a balance.</p>
            </article>
            <article>
                <span>02</span>
                <h4>Choose a payment method</h4>
                <p>Pay through the school's approved bank, mobile-money, or finance-office channel.</p>
            </article>
            <article>
                <span>03</span>
                <h4>Send the receipt</h4>
                <p>Include the student's name and ID on the payment reference, then share the receipt with the office.</p>
            </article>
        </div>

        <div class="payment-methods">
            <article>
                <h4>Bank transfer</h4>
                <p><strong>Account:</strong> Add the school's official account details here.</p>
                <p><strong>Reference:</strong> Student name and student ID.</p>
            </article>
            <article>
                <h4>Mobile money</h4>
                <p><strong>Paybill:</strong> 123456</p>
                <p><strong>Account number:</strong> Student name</p>
            </article>
            <article>
                <h4>Finance office</h4>
                <p>Visit the school office during working hours and request an official receipt.</p>
            </article>
        </div>

        <a class="hero-button" href="/contact">Ask the finance office</a>
    </section>

    <div class="fee-note">

        <h3>Important Information</h3>

        <p>
            Fees should be paid before the beginning of each term.
        </p>

        <p>
            Please contact the school administration for more information
            about payments and additional charges.
        </p>

    </div>

</main>

<footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 Smart School. All Rights Reserved.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>